---
title: Pasta
servings: 2
---

= Dough

Mix @flour{200%g} and @water{100%ml} together until smooth.

= Filling

Combine @cheese{100%g}(grated) and @spinach{50%g}, then season.

> Serve the same day.

Lay out @rice paper{1}.\
Top with @avocado{1/2}(sliced). Fry in #frying pan{2} for ~{25%minutes}, then ~rest and ~eggs{3%minutes}.
